1. The code to train a helpful only model preference model is Reward_model_preference_model_helpful_antrophic_dataset_Qwen_0_6B.ipynb
It can be found on hugginface Realmbird/helpfulness-preference-model-qwen-0.6B-merged

2. Code to train the RLHF helpful only ppo model is Helpful_RLHF_Qwen_0_6B_ipynb.ipynb
The model can be found on huggingface Realmbird/rlhf-helpful-only-qwen-0.6b

3. The code to use the helpful only model to create the critique and revisions is Direct_critique_response_Creating_Dataset_of_responses_to_red_teaming_prompts.ipynb
The dataset can be found Realmbird/sl_cai_dataset_100
